# Bring My Flowers - WhatsApp Chatbot

## Project Overview
Automated WhatsApp chatbot for flower delivery business that handles customer messages, manages orders/inventory, notifies delivery personnel, and generates daily business summaries.

## Tech Stack
- Runtime: Node.js + TypeScript
- WhatsApp: Baileys (unofficial WhatsApp Web API)
- LLM: Ollama (local) with llama3/mistral
- Storage: Excel files via xlsx
- Scheduling: node-cron

## Key Components
1. WhatsApp Bot (src/bot/whatsapp.ts)
2. Ollama Client (src/llm/ollama.ts)
3. Excel Manager (src/data/excelManager.ts)
4. Message Handler (src/handlers/messageHandler.ts)
5. Delivery Notifier (src/notifications/deliveryNotifier.ts)
6. Daily Summary Generator (src/summary/dailySummary.ts)

## Development Guidelines
- Always use TypeScript with strict types
- Log all actions using pino logger
- Backup Excel before writes
- Handle errors gracefully with user-friendly messages
- Rate limit customer messages
- Use proper file locking for Excel operations

## Testing
- npm run test:ollama - Test Ollama connection
- npm run add:sample - Add sample data
- npm run dev - Run in development mode

